Package: saisdata
Title: Course Data for the SAIS MIEF R Workshop
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Teal", "Emery", , "lte@tealinsights.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ready-to-use data for the two-day R workshop of the Master of
    International Economics and Finance (MIEF) at Johns Hopkins SAIS: the
    International Monetary Fund's World Economic Outlook of October 2026 as a
    tidy country panel, the same source in the IMF's own layout for its two
    largest country groups, and the World Bank's country groups. One line,
    library(saisdata), loads them all. The code is MIT licensed; the data keep
    their own terms (the IMF's terms of use, and CC BY 4.0 for the World
    Bank's data).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5)
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
